{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29112","headline":"哭杨攀处士 · 许浑","name":"哭杨攀处士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"先生忧道乐清贫，白发终爲不仕身。\n嵇阮没来无酒客，应刘亡後少诗人。\n山前月照荒坟晓，溪上花开旧宅春。\n昨夜回舟更惆怅，至今钟磬满南邻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29112.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29112","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}